<title>CANADA: Suncor cuts Canada posted oil prices.</title>
<headline>Suncor cuts Canada posted oil prices.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Suncor Inc said on Thursday it</p>
<p>lowered the price it would pay for some grades of crude oil by C$2.00/cubic metre or C$0.32/barrel, effective immediately.</p>
<p>The new prices were listed as follows:</p>
<p>Edmonton light sweet C$181.00/cubic metre, or C$28.78/barrel</p>
<p>Cromer light sour C$169.00/cubic metre, or C$26.87/barrel</p>
<p>Midale at Cromer C$151.00/cubic metre, or C$24.01/barrel</p>
<p>((Reuters Calgary Bureau (403) 531-1624))</p>
